								<wikidot:authorUserId>1324229</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The first of two stories about <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-186">SCP-186</a>. This is my version of a story idea that Kalinin mentioned to me many yonks ago, and allowed me to use. Thanks to Decibelle, Silber, Rumetzen, Dmatix, Vince, LadieKatie, ProcyonLotor, Perelka_L, and Roget (as well as anyone else whose name escapes me at the moment) for looking this over</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">What&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;hell&nbsp;is&nbsp;up&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;ending?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Warned&nbsp;you&nbsp;about&nbsp;spoilers,&nbsp;bruh</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>Remnants of an unknown incendiary device believed to have been detonated at the close of the conflict, accounting for what is estimated to be 34% of total casualties</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p>e: Second tale, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/smothering-dreams">Smothering Dreams</a> is now up.</p> 
				 	]]>
